        "vertical_align": "align-items-center",
        "heading": "Engineered to last using premium quality materials",
        "content": "<p>Most filters are made from plastic, which can leach harmful chemicals into your drinking water. In contrast, we use high-grade coconut shell activated carbon — one of the most effective filtration materials on earth — along with granular activated carbon derived from natural coconut husks, to remove impurities and heavy metals like lead and zinc. All of this advanced natural filtration is housed in high-quality, food-grade AISI 304 Stainless Steel. The result is a refined, durable filtration system that delivers crisp, clean drinking water for years to come.</p>",
        "video_id": "",
