    "secondary_details_qhCfY7": {
      "type": "secondary-details",
      "name": "Secondary Details",
      "settings": {
        "style": "bg-white",
        "heading": "Removes >95% of Fluoride & Arsenic with “First-of-its-Kind” Filtration System",
        "content": "<p><br/>Fluoride is added to public drinking water for approximately three out of four Americans. However, there is growing concern in the scientific community that excessive fluoride levels could potentially be toxic to the brain or even increase the risk of the rare cancer, osteosarcoma.<br/><br/>Designed as an essential add-on to our Gravity Water Filter system, our scientists have developed a first-of-its-kind fluoride filtration system that removes more than 95% of fluoride from drinking water while retaining essential nutrients. Housed in rust-resistant AISI 304 Stainless Steel, the POSTreat Fluoride Removal Filter Elements also remove arsenic without leaching polyurethane or microplastics into your water like other filtration systems.<br/><br/>Engineered for everyday use, the filter requires a simple top-up of the proprietary filtration media every four months or after treating up to 1,060 gallons of water. This makes it the most effective and sustainable fluoride removal system on the market, helping you maintain a healthy lifestyle.<br/></p>",
        "buttonlink": "",
        "buttontext": "",
        "afterbutton": "",
        "custom_id": ""
      }
    },
