        "style": "bg-white",
        "layout": "copy-image-copy",
        "vertical_align": "align-items-center",
        "heading": "Save $1,000s on bottled water or a whole-home system.",
        "content": "<p><br/>Bottled water might be clean, but it’s expensive. It can cost over $1,000 per year, create waste that harms the environment, and take up valuable space in your home. You could install an in-home filtration system, but those are costly too - with a substantial upfront investment, ongoing maintenance, and repairs. Plus, they aren’t portable if you’re renting or decide to move.<br/><br/>Phoenix Gravity Water Filters offer a more convenient and affordable solution, delivering delicious, filtered water every day without the hassle or expense of bottled water or large home systems.</p>",
        "column_img": "shopify://shop_images/filter-system.png",
        "video_id": "",
        "img_width": 0,
        "large_image": "img-standard",
        "second_content": "",
